    {
      "path": "snowtower/blocks/10770/nbt/Items/0",
      "sourceTag": {
        "pages": [
          "PyLON EXTRAKTING/recykling:\nI see them wanduring in the nite. Soldiurs marching thru mountains of twice-dead bugz, artificed metallik giants tearing down the pylons that once held our cities togethur. Then, as the old king's corpse rises, they take the   ",
          "pylon harts into there dark blu towers, They break the corez apart like boiling snow.\nThat iz how they do it, that iz how they gro there mashines and build there grand towers. The secret is in the cores, great latent power from the Sun itself of which Phoenem dared to keep from us",
          "under loq and key.\n\nYes. Thats it; I must findBUILD the keys, like the onez the bugz of the towers use to hide there secrets away. \nThere is work too be don."
        ]
      },
